  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Ctr Fort. Institucional Ministerio de Relaciones Exteriores</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening of Ministry of Foreign Affairs</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">THE OBJECTIVE IS TO DEVELOPE, IN THE MINISTRY OF EXTERNAL RELATIONS, TECHNICAL AND INSTITUTIONAL SKILLS TO CONDUCT ECONOMIC INTEGRATION MATTERS. THE MAIN COMPONENTS ARE: 1. STRENGTHENING OF MANAGEMENT ADMINISTRATION; 2. STUDIES TO CREATE A DATA BASE; 3. TRAINING OF PERSONNEL; 4.INFORMATICS PROGRAM; 5. COMMUNICATION AND DISSEMINATION OF INFORMATION; 6. PHYSICAL INFRASTRUCTURE.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES"></narrative>
  </description>
